Numpy Tutorial :

    --> Numpy is a general-purpose array-processing packagee. it provides a high-performance multidimensional array object, and
    tools for working with these arrays. it is the fundamental package for scientific computing with python.

what is an array :
    --> An array is a data structure that stores values of same data type. in python, this is the main difference between arrays and 
    lists. While python list can contain values corresponding to different types, arrays in python can only contain values corresponding
    to same data type